WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
I want to go out

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,800
Waiting for your eighteenth birthday

3
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:05,000
Grandpa will be back soon

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,920
I’ll give you a special birthday gift grandpa then

5
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:09,560
Where do you always go when you travel far away?

6
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:11,200
Can't I follow you?

7
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,680
Do our job

8
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:17,280
Don't just run around and ask questions. I know you're gone. I'll go home and not come to the paper shop to take over the work privately.

9
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:20,100
Don’t go far and don’t run around

10
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,250
Grandpa never missed an appointment

11
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:26,850
Why do I feel so uneasy this time?

12
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:28,570
The food was heated three times

13
00:00:28,570 --> 00:00:30,010
It's getting dark

14
00:00:30,010 --> 00:00:36,820
Why isn’t grandpa coming back? Xiaotie

15
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:39,910
Grandpa was wrong

16
00:00:39,910 --> 00:00:42,870
Grandpa can't stay with you anymore

17
00:00:42,870 --> 00:00:49,580
Xiaotie wants to grow up healthy and grandpa

18
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:50,900
Grandpa, don’t scare me

19
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:57,860
What's wrong with you? It's a dream

20
00:00:57,860 --> 00:01:00,660
But why is this dream so real?

21
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:04,830
where are you

22
00:01:04,830 --> 00:01:06,710
Is this Zhou Jianshe's house?

23
00:01:06,710 --> 00:01:08,630
Why am I his grandson?

24
00:01:08,630 --> 00:01:09,750
Where are your adults?

25
00:01:09,750 --> 00:01:11,070
Let them come out

26
00:01:11,070 --> 00:01:14,180
I am the only sister left in the family

27
00:01:14,180 --> 00:01:16,140
Your grandpa is just a drowning child

28
00:01:16,140 --> 00:01:17,540
Drag the child up

29
00:01:17,540 --> 00:01:19,420
I ran out of energy and left.

30
00:01:19,420 --> 00:01:27,090
It's all because of our children

31
00:01:27,090 --> 00:01:28,490
What are you lying about?

32
00:01:28,490 --> 00:01:31,010
It was not your child who died but my grandfather

33
00:01:31,010 --> 00:01:32,090
Give me back my grandpa

34
00:01:32,090 --> 00:01:33,410
Why don't you die?

35
00:01:35,010 --> 00:01:36,850
The young ones in the Rou family are going against death, and so are the old ones.

36
00:01:36,850 --> 00:01:38,450
Maybe they are all Zhou Tieke

37
00:01:38,450 --> 00:01:39,450
What did you say?

38
00:01:39,450 --> 00:01:40,650
say it again

39
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,440
What do you want to change?
